English Summary (non-binding; the Chinese text above prevails)

You MAY, free of charge:
  (a) download this repository, open it in Godot, build and run it locally
      for personal study of Godot 4 / GDScript / 2D platformer development;
  (b) read the source and reuse the *ideas* and techniques in your own work;
  (c) teach, stream or write about the project non-commercially, without
      redistributing the source or asset files;
  (d) submit issues and pull requests.

You MAY NOT, without prior written permission from the author:
  (a) use the project or any part of it commercially;
  (b) redistribute the source, binaries, PCK/APK or assets in any form,
      including mirrors, repacks and modified versions;
  (c) publish derivative works based on this project;
  (d) extract the art, audio, fonts or shaders for use in other projects;
  (e) remove copyright notices, credits or this license file;
  (f) use the project's code or assets to train or fine-tune externally
      served machine-learning models, or include them in public datasets.

This is NOT an open-source license. All rights not expressly granted are
reserved. The project is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind, and
the author accepts no liability for any damages arising from its use.
Any violation terminates all rights granted here immediately; you must then
delete every copy in your possession. Sections 2-5 survive termination.
Third-party components listed in Section 6 remain under their own licenses.

For any other use, contact the author via the details in README.
